    "id": "v2-da0e32-p9-practice-slot-4-root",
    "type": "question",
    "label": null,
    "prompt": "Mia is $x$ years old. Her brother is 4 years older and her sister is 2 years younger.\nThe sum of their three ages is less than 50.\nWrite an inequality involving $x$ and solve it. What can you say about Mia’s age?",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$x+(x+4)+(x-2)<50$, so $x<16$. Mia is younger than 16 years.",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}x+(x+4)+(x-2)&<50\\\\3x+2&<50\\\\3x&<48\\\\x&<16\\end{align*}$$\nMia is younger than 16 years.",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
